# Console Pi - xoay vong nhat ky, giu it nhat 60 ngay ma khong lam day the nho
#
# VI SAO CAN GIU 60 NGAY: may nay dung o hien truong (cong ty khach, khong
# SSH vao duoc luc do) - neu co su co thi phai DOI VE NHA moi xem lai duoc.
# Neu nhat ky bi xoay vong mat truoc khi kip xem, coi nhu mat dau vet vinh
# vien. Yeu cau thuc te: giu it nhat 60 ngay cho MOI file nhat ky cua
# Console Pi (khong chi rieng 1 file).
#
# VI SAO VAN PHAI GIOI HAN DUNG LUONG: Pi dung ngoai hien truong nhieu thang
# lien, cac file nhat ky tu ghi them mai khong ai xoa - da do that:
# console-pi-fallback.log tang lien tuc (moi 2 phut ghi 1 dong khi kiem tra
# WiFi). The nho Pi thuong chi 8-32GB va DAY THE la mot trong nhung nguyen
# nhan hong Pi pho bien nhat (he thong khong ghi duoc gi nua, dich vu chet
# hang loat). Dung "daily + maxsize" de xoay vong ca khi dat moc thoi gian
# LAN khi phinh to bat thuong (vd loi lap lai lien tuc), "compress" de 60
# ban cu chiem it cho hon nhieu so voi 60 ban khong nen.
#
# console-pi-errors.log: TRUOC DAY tu xoay vong rieng bang RotatingFileHandler
# trong Python (theo dung LOI GIAI THICH cu con luu trong ui/errlog.py), gay
# xung dot 2 co che xoay vong tren cung 1 file. Da doi errlog.py sang chi
# ghi them (append) don gian, GIAO HET viec xoay vong cho logrotate o day -
# chi con 1 co che duy nhat, tranh nham lan/mat du lieu giua 2 ben.
/var/log/console-pi-fallback.log
/var/log/console-pi-netmiko.log
/var/log/console-pi-api.log
/var/log/console-pi-selftest.log
/var/log/console-pi-dhcptest.log
/var/log/console-pi-errors.log
{
    daily
    rotate 60
    maxsize 5M
    compress
    delaycompress
    missingok
    notifempty
    copytruncate
}
